  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Urban Transformation in the Southern Levant</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to understanding the past and present urbanization processes to help improve living conditions, alleviate poverty, and enhance urban planning in the Southern Levant. The expected result of this project is institutional capacity built in higher education at BZU, by focus on research and education through
the study of urban transformation in the Southern Levant.</narrative>
  </description>
